  "sourceFacts": {
    "horizontalBasis": "Named Садовый домик node13324187201 lies in building way220075410, independently mapped south of Житня/way220075392. The13.5x6.8m envelope and nominal5m height anchor the complete building; room front is set back1.1m within the envelope for the photo-led upper gallery. X northeast along long facade, Z southeast toward the interpreted approach, baked native axes with heading0 at the unchanged assigned garden-house anchor. The labeled garden-house photograph in the ordinary2012 estate walk guides log/board hierarchy, red hip roof, multiple lower gates, upper gallery and right-descending stair. Similar historic storage typology is shared by the nearby granary; this model has its own location, footprint, gate layout, access and roof. Trees hide exact bay inventory and absolute front assignment remains approximate.",
    "architecturalHeights": "Approximate photo-led scale:2.25m log lower room,2.05m boarded upper room and1.5m hip rise, gallery at2.25m with.92m open rails and12 stair treads. Nominal map5m is a scale cue; all historical heights, timber sections, roof condition, hidden rear openings, thresholds and accessibility remain reconstructed."
